    {
      "text": "After creating playbooks and automation rules, you can manage automations to refine how and when actions are taken."
    },
    {
      "text": "When managing automation rules, you can perform the following actions:"
    },
    {
      "text": "Edit an Automation Rule"
    },
    {
      "text": "To edit an automation rule:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Agentic SecOps Platform Admin Portal, click Agentic SOC or Identities.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          62
        ],
        [
          66,
          76
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, go to Automations > Automation Rules.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          35,
          46
        ],
        [
          49,
          65
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Automation Rules page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Hover over the automation rule you want to edit, and click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          63,
          67
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Edit Automation Rule page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          24
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Make the necessary changes.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Delete an Automation Rule"
    },
    {
      "text": "To delete an automation rule:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Agentic SecOps Platform Admin Portal, click Agentic SOC or Identities.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          62
        ],
        [
          66,
          76
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, go to Automations > Automation Rules.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          35,
          46
        ],
        [
          49,
          65
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Automation Rules page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Hover over the automation rule you want to delete, and click the Delete icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          65,
          71
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Delete Automation Rule window opens.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          26
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Delete Automation Rule window, click Delete.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          29
        ],
        [
          44,
          50
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "View Automation Rule Audit Logs"
    },
    {
      "text": "To view automation rule audit logs:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Agentic SecOps Platform Admin Portal, click Agentic SOC or Identities.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          62
        ],
        [
          66,
          76
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, go to Automations > Automation Rules.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          35,
          46
        ],
        [
          49,
          65
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Automation Rules page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the automation rule that you want to view logs for.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "The Edit Automation Rule page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          24
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Edit Automation Rule page, click More > Audit Logs.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          27
        ],
        [
          40,
          44
        ],
        [
          47,
          57
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The automation rule's Audit Logs page appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          22,
          32
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Review the automation rule's audit logs. You can sort each column. For each log, you can see:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5
    },
    {
      "item": "Time: The time the action occurred.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Operation: The type of operation made.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Type: The entity the playbook affects.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "User Name: The user who made the changes.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click to expand a log, and view the playbook differences in JSON.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "(Optional) Click the Download icon to download all audit logs in the current list from the last 90 days.",
      "depth": 0,
